     "gloss_en": "לא, לעולם מבחוץ, ודקאמרת היינו ניקבה -- לא צריכא לרבי שמעון: his 'to the bronchi' is said of a perforation without loss; with loss even R' Shimon concedes (= p_chasra_mibachutz, p_rs_nekev_bli_chisaron)",
